 ('Reading · Instructions',text('Science of Baking: Don’t Overdo It',['**Do not overmix** the batter: it will **overwork** the gluten. **Don’t overbake** either; a few minutes too long and the cake dries out. Salt **plays a crucial role** in flavour, and “tsp” **stands for** teaspoon. **Never overlook** the oven temperature.','If you **overestimate** your skills, you may **overcook** the cake. Check it early!'],kicker='RECIPE',by='Kitchen Lab',gloss=[('batter','massa'),('gluten','glúten'),('flavour','sabor'),('oven','forno')])),
